## 9. SELECT Queries

### 9.1 Display All Products

```sql
SELECT * FROM Products;
```

### 9.2 Display Product Names and Prices

```sql
SELECT product_name, price
FROM Products;
```

### 9.3 Display All Customers

```sql
SELECT * FROM Customers;
```

### 9.4 Display Customer Names and Cities

```sql
SELECT customer_name, city
FROM Customers;
```

## 10. WHERE Queries

### 10.1 Products Costing More Than ₹5,000

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE price > 5000;
```

### 10.2 Customers from Chennai

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Customers
WHERE city = 'Chennai';
```

### 10.3 Products Priced Between ₹1,000 and ₹10,000

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE price BETWEEN 1000 AND 10000;
```

## 11. ORDER BY Queries

### 11.1 Sort Products by Price in Ascending Order

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
ORDER BY price ASC;
```

### 11.2 Sort Products by Price in Descending Order

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
ORDER BY price DESC;
```

### 11.3 Sort Customers Alphabetically

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Customers
ORDER BY customer_name ASC;
```

## 12. DISTINCT Queries

### 12.1 Display Unique Product Categories

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT category
FROM Products;
```

### 12.2 Display Unique Customer Cities

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT city
FROM Customers;
```

## 13. Product Search Queries

### 13.1 Search Products by Category

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE category = 'Electronics';
```

### 13.2 Search Available Products

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE availability = 'Available';
```

### 13.3 Search Out-of-Stock Products

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE availability = 'Out of Stock';
```

### 13.4 Search Products by Name

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE product_name LIKE '%Smart%';
```

### 13.5 Search Products Using IN

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE category IN ('Electronics', 'Accessories');
```

## 14. Filtering Conditions

### 14.1 AND Operator

Find available Electronics products priced below ₹30,000.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE category = 'Electronics'
AND price < 30000
AND availability = 'Available';
```

